      "hanzi": "王明是学生，他有一个好朋友叫李月。",
      "startMs": 0,
      "endMs": 4240,
      "durationMs": 4240,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_journee_wang_ming_h_wm_1.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "h_wm_2",
      "hanzi": "李月也是学生。今天天气很好，不冷也不热。",
      "startMs": 4240,
      "endMs": 9920,
      "durationMs": 4720,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_journee_wang_ming_h_wm_2.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "h_wm_3",
      "hanzi": "上午，王明去学校学习汉语。他看见李月，李月很高兴。",
      "startMs": 9920,
      "endMs": 16560,
      "durationMs": 5600,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_journee_wang_ming_h_wm_3.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "h_wm_4",
      "hanzi": "中午，王明和李月去饭店。王明吃米饭、喝茶，李月吃米饭、喝水。",
      "startMs": 16560,
      "endMs": 25600,
      "durationMs": 8000,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_journee_wang_ming_h_wm_4.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "h_wm_5",
      "hanzi": "下午，他们回家。王明看电视，李月看书。",
      "startMs": 25600,
      "endMs": 31200,
      "durationMs": 4640,
      "audioUrl": "/audio/readings/histoire_journee_wang_ming_h_wm_5.mp3"
    },
    {
      "sentenceId": "h_wm_6",
      "hanzi": "今天，王明和李月都很高兴。",
